---
layout: base.njk
---
<section class="page-hero grid-overlay relative pt-16 pb-16 md:pt-20 md:pb-20">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <a href="/cases/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-techblue-300 hover:text-white transition-colors mb-6">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
      도입 사례 목록으로
    </a>
    <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold text-techblue-300 bg-techblue-500/10 border border-techblue-500/30 rounded-full px-3 py-1 mb-4">{{ tag }}</span>
    <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white leading-snug">{{ title }}</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">{{ summary }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 md:p-8 mb-10">
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 mb-3">도입 전</p>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            {% for item in before %}
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">{{ item.label }}</p>
              <p class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-700">{{ item.value }}</p>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-techblue-500 mb-3">도입 후</p>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            {% for item in after %}
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">{{ item.label }}</p>
              <p class="text-lg font-bold text-techblue-500">{{ item.value }}</p>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-h2:text-xl prose-h2:font-bold prose-h2:text-navy-900 prose-h2:mt-10 prose-h2:mb-3 prose-p:text-slate-600 prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-li:text-slate-600">
      {{ content | safe }}
    </article>

    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200">* 상기 사례는 도입 효과를 설명하기 위한 예시이며, 실제 결과는 설비 환경에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다.</p>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <a href="/contact/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-techblue-500 hover:bg-techblue-400 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-techblue-500/20 transition-colors">
        우리 설비에도 적용 가능한지 문의하기
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
